\noindent \textbf{Analyze.} In this phase, the controller waits for an inference request and transitions to the \textit{Decide} phase when a new request arrives or a previously running application completes execution. In case of a new inference request, the controller receives the \textit{Signature map} of each application from \textit{Model Interpreter}, and the system status, including cluster availability and \ac{gpu} frequency level. If a previously running application completes execution, the controller reads the system status and transitions to the \textit{Decide} phase to update the system configuration. The same event is notified in case an application is remapped in the previous control cycle. 

