As a consequence of \eqref{e:Fix}, the fixed-point sets of the DR operators for different parameters can be completely disjoint (see Remark~\ref{r:disjoint}) and thus \eqref{e:dr-fne} can no longer be used to directly analyse convergence of a variable stepsize version of of DR given by $(T_{\gamma_n}^nx_0)_{\nnn}$ for $(\gamma_n)$ in $\mathbb{R}_{++}$.

