%\end{equation*}}\todo[inline]{unnecessary?}

Having described the setting that builds the graph-based DR method of \cite{bredies2024graph}, we next collect some facts that sets this algorithm in the framework of Section~\ref{s:abstract-framework-convergence} with the goal of applying Theorem~\ref{t:abstractconv} to obtain convergence of the corresponding relocated fixed-point iteration.

