\hline
$\sin^2 2\theta_{12}$ & $\sin^2\theta_{23}$ & $\sin^2 2\theta_{13}$ & $\Delta m^2_
\text{eff}$ (eV$^2$) & $\Delta m^2_{21}$ (eV$^2$) & $\delta_{\rm CP}$ & Mass Ordering\\
\hline
0.855 & 0.5 & 0.0875 & $2.49\times 10^{-3}$ & $7.4\times10^{-5}$ & 0 & Normal (NO)\\
