\begin{proof}
The pairs of ordered pairs of the function

\begin{equation} \label{2.3.90}
 \Psi_{\lambda}(z) = m_{\lambda} \cdot p_{\lambda}(z) + \sum_{\substack{k=1 \\ k \ne \lambda}}^{n} m_k \cdot p_k(z) + t = 0 
